    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61555" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰγῷος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγώϊος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the hare</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1110
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.138f
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ λ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα</span>) <i>hare's flesh</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.46
			</span></i>: and generally, <i>dainties, delicacies</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῆν ἐν πᾶσι λαγῴοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					709
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1006
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				1196
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				174.10
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
